        "id": "7d81123d"
      },
      "source": [
        "### Clean Column Names\n",
        "\n",
        "To ensure consistency and ease of use, we will clean up the column names by removing extra spaces and standardizing them."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "9a8b4bc7",
        "outputId": "a6e6b300-a6fb-4847-fdaf-85a4b1c26d8d"
      },
      "source": [
        "df.columns = df.columns.str.replace('  ', ' ').str.strip()\n",
        "print('\\nCleaned Column Names:')\n",
        "print(df.columns.tolist())"
      ],
      "execution_count": 8,
