        "## 3. Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) & Feature Engineering\n",
        "\n",
        "Now that our data is prepared, we will perform Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) to understand the underlying patterns, relationships, and distributions within the data. This will help us identify potential features for our model and inform our feature engineering strategy.\n",
        "\n",
        "We will start by examining the distribution of the target variable, 'Churn'."
