      "source": [
        "## 7. Validate Assumptions\n",
        "\n",
        "For Logistic Regression, assumptions include linearity of independent variables with log odds, independence of errors, and absence of multicollinearity. While a detailed check of all assumptions can be complex, often the model's performance provides initial guidance. For practical purposes in this overview, we will proceed directly to evaluating model performance."
      ]
    },
